  "application_type_full": "Consent to display an advertisement",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the reports, specifications and drawings detailed 192302 REV F pages 1 to 5, Location Plan dated 17/07/2026.  \r\nReason: To ensure a satisfactory standard of development and to allow the local planning authority to review any potential changes to the scheme. \r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The maximum steady brightness of the trough light below the fascia sign hereby permitted is not to exceed 250 candelas per sq.m.\r\nReason: To ensure the sign does not have an adverse effect on the amenity of the area in accordance with Council policy LP9 of the Local Plan and to comply with the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Condition : 3 - The maximum steady brightness of the uplight illuminating the 3D goat hereby permitted is not to exceed 250 candelas per sq.m. \r\nReason: To ensure the proposed sign does not have an adverse effect on the amenity of the area in accordance with Council policy LP9 of the Local Plan and to comply with the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Condition : 4 - The maximum steady brightness of the menu cases hereby permitted is not to exceed 250 candelas per sq.m. \r\nReason: To ensure the proposed sign does not have an adverse effect on the amenity of the area in accordance with Council policy LP9 of the Local Plan and to comply with the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Condition : 5 - The illumination hereby permitted shall be by static illumination only. \r\nReason: In the interest of highway safety and of the visual amenities of the locality in accordance with Council policy LP9 of the Local Plan and to comply with the National Planning Policy Framework.\r\n"
  ],
